        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This may be implemented as an executable jar.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "It may have \"special\" access to Fedora (beyond the web service interface) to operate directly on the files, but this is note required.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "At a minimum, MUST take a list of PIDs to validate.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "At a minimum, MUST access Fedora on line via API-A.",
          "type": "text"
         }
