     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: cwilper<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=189298<br/>\nOriginator: NO</p>\n\n<p>This may be implemented as an executable jar.<br/>\nIt may have \"special\" access to Fedora (beyond the web service interface) to operate directly on the files, but this is note required.<br/>\nAt a minimum, MUST take a list of PIDs to validate.<br/>\nAt a minimum, MUST access Fedora on line via API-A.</p>",
